# Local CI before release tag

**Never** create or push `release/X.Y.Z` until **latest `origin/main`** passed local quality + tests. A green `release-prep/X.Y.Z` PR is **not** a substitute — PR Typecheck & lint can skip `run-pr-quality.sh` (`eslint .`). Release **always** runs it.

```bash
git fetch origin main && git checkout main && git pull origin main
bash scripts/ci/run-pr-quality.sh
npm run build:native
bash scripts/ci/run-pr-tests-full.sh
npm run ci:verify:release-ts
```

All must exit 0, then `git tag release/X.Y.Z` and `git push origin refs/tags/release/X.Y.Z`.

**Lesson (0.8.1):** first tag failed Release lint after a green prep PR. Fix on `main` before retagging. See [`scripts/RELEASE.md`](../../scripts/RELEASE.md).
